  "description": "Even though Ji Jiri is the most powerful person in the world, he lives as if he's the weakest.\n\nJiri is born to a mother who bears immense power and a father from a gangster family. Ever since he was a newborn, he has shown his Herculean strength by demolishing his own house, furniture, and even his dad(?). \n\nIn order to let him live a normal life, his parents brainwashed him.\n\n“You are the worst to ever walk on earth.”\n“Never get close to anyone.”\n\nThis is the story of Ji Jiri’s personal growth and overcoming traumas to become the strongest man on earth.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
